[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4262244780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118652#issuecomment-4262244780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118652","id":4262244780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-DLGs","user":{"login":"ArokhSlade","id":139560570,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFGGeg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139560570?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade","html_url":"https://github.com/ArokhSlade","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T17:47:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T17:47:59Z","body":"I think the cause is in godot\\editor\\import\\3d\\post_import_plugin_skeleton_rest_fixer.cpp\n\n<img width=\"512\" height=\"118\" alt=\"post_import_plugin_skeleton_rest_fixer::_get_internal_option_visibility in godot 4.6.2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/054217e3-1bd8-4adf-936d-f9ff4acd1305\" />\nscreenshot from version 4.6.2.stable\n\nNotice on line 81 post_import_plugin_skeleton_rest_fixer::_get_internal_option_visibility returns true as the default case.\nI think this is the cause for the error.\n\nThis function gets called by \nResourceImporterScene::_get_internal_option_visibility() in godot\\editor\\import\\3d\\resource_importer_scene.cpp\n\n<img width=\"1557\" height=\"163\" alt=\"ResourceImporterScene::_get_internal_option_visibility line 2456\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb228de7-9a86-4404-a6f9-0442a968500f\" />\n\nStepping through the program, I found that the array post_importer_plugins has 4 entries. the first two are empty, the third is the post_import_plugin_skeleton_rest_fixer which seems to be always enabled and the fourth is from the plugin in the project.\n\nAs stated above, I think the cause for the error is that post_import_plugin_skeleton_rest_fixer returns true by default\nThus, it always intercepts/overrides any user plugin's implementation.\n(Notice also the todo comment at line 2453.)\n\nMy suggested solution is to have it return null by default.\n\nAs the documentation for [_get_internal_option_visibility ](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_editorscenepostimportplugin.html#class-editorscenepostimportplugin-private-method-get-option-visibility) states:\n> Return true or false whether a given option should be visible. Return null to ignore.\n\nIn a branch I changed post_import_plugin_skeleton_rest_fixer::_get_internal_option_visibility to return null and that seemed to fix it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4262244780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4286357617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118652#issuecomment-4286357617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118652","id":4286357617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_fKBx","user":{"login":"ArokhSlade","id":139560570,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFGGeg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139560570?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade","html_url":"https://github.com/ArokhSlade","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArokhSlade/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-21T06:26:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T06:26:06Z","body":"bugfix pr has been [merged](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118656#issuecomment-4281600207)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4286357617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]